Start here. These are the most relevant tools if you are building directly on Stellar during StellarX Philippines.

| Resource | What it is | Where to find it |
|---|---|---|
| **Stella** | Official AI assistant for Stellar developer questions | https://developers.stellar.org (look for the chat icon); also `#stella-help` on the Stellar developer Discord if available |
