| **Scaffold Stellar** | CLI tool for managing Stellar app development lifecycle, contracts, testing, and deployment | https://scaffoldstellar.org |
| **x402** | Per-request HTTP payment protocol for AI agents using Soroban auth entry signing | https://developers.stellar.org/docs/build/apps/x402 |

