| **AutoGen (AG2)** | Multi-agent conversational workflows | https://github.com/ag2-ai/ag2 |
| **OpenAI Agents SDK** | Production-grade agent workflows and tracing | https://openai.github.io/openai-agents-python/ |

### When to care about these
Only reach for these if your product itself is agentic.

Examples:
- AI-powered wallet assistant
- AI payment routing assistant
- AI-driven support or finance workflow
- autonomous agents making requests or triggering financial actions

If your project is mainly a wallet, payment app, or DeFi frontend, you probably do **not** need these frameworks.

