## 6. Rapid Prototyping and App Builders

These tools are useful when you need to move from idea to interface quickly.

| Tool | Free Tier | Best For | Link |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Bolt.new** | Free tier available | Full-stack app generation from prompts | https://bolt.new |
| **v0** | Credits-based free tier | React / Next.js UI generation | https://v0.app |
| **Google AI Studio** | Fully free | Large-context prompting, planning, debugging, code understanding | https://aistudio.google.com |

### How to use them well
Use these for:
- UI scaffolding
- product mockups
- initial app shell generation
- front-end acceleration

Do **not** rely on them blindly for:
- protocol-critical transaction logic
- security-sensitive flows
- wallet signing logic
- final production architecture

They are best used as accelerators, not as sources of truth.

